        "original_id": "3a275060-750e-5dcb-b9b3-bc5ddacd3308",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Long Day's Journey into Night (1962 film), Long Day's Journey into Night (play)\n- People: Eugene O'Neill, André Previn, Boris Kaufman\n- Roles: Screenwriter source, Composer, Cinematographer\n\nFacts:\n- Long Day's Journey into Night (1962 film) used Eugene O'Neill's play directly as its screenplay rather than adapting it.\n- André George Previn was born Andreas Ludwig Priwin on April 6, 1929, and he is a German-American pianist, conductor, and composer.\n- André Previn composed the music score for Long Day's Journey into Night (1962 film).\n- Boris Kaufman was the cinematographer for Long Day's Journey into Night (1962 film).",
